cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GeoEscala: geologic time scale bars for figures"
message: >-
  If you use GeoEscala, please cite it together with the ICS International
  Chronostratigraphic Chart, the source of the ages and colors (see
  references).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Darío
    family-names: Torres Sánchez
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/PlaticandodelaTierra/geoescala"
url: "https://platicandodelatierra.github.io/geoescala/"
abstract: >-
  A web application, with no installation and no server, that draws
  geologic time scale bars with the official ages and colors of the ICS
  International Chronostratigraphic Chart (v2026/06), ready for thesis and
  journal figures: physical size in mm, editable SVG text, PNG at 300 or
  600 dpi and vector PDF, with Spanish and English interface and labels.
keywords:
  - geology
  - earth science
  - geologic time scale
  - stratigraphy
  - chronostratigraphy
  - education
  - scientific figures
  - Spanish
references:
  - type: article
    authors:
      - family-names: Cohen
        given-names: K. M.
      - family-names: Harper
        given-names: D. A. T.
      - family-names: Gibbard
        given-names: P. L.
      - family-names: Car
        given-names: N.
    title: "The ICS international chronostratigraphic chart this decade"
    journal: Episodes
    volume: 48
    issue: 1
    start: 105
    end: 115
    year: 2025
    doi: 10.18814/epiiugs/2025/025001
